<title>UK: SGA sets waerrants on Zurich Regd..</title>
<headline>SGA sets waerrants on Zurich Regd..</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Societe Generale Acceptance NV has issued 10 million American-style call warrants, on Zurich Versicherung Regd. shares, lead manager Societe Generale Bank &amp; Trust Zurich said.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 50 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    675 CHF		   PREMIUM	25.1 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.39 CHF		  GEARING	8.6 X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	30.JUL.99		 PAYDATE	30.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXCHANGE	  MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  595 CHF</p>
<p> NOTES	     PRICES QUOTED ON REUTER PAGE    SGECHF08</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
